

Get-Member (or gm): Isolate a specific variable or command in the script and pipe it to Get-Member. It strips away the mystery by printing every property (data) and method (actions) available on that object

complex custom object

Set-PSDebug -Trace 1

the noun prefix usually gives away the module

Get-Help <CmdletName> -Detailed

rich objects

$variable | Get-Member

Get-UnfamiliarCmdlet | Select-Object -First 1 *

